      "message": "fix(ui): keep the view box's near plane far behind the ortho eye\n\nThe review asked for the ortho near plane to reach far behind the\neye plane: -((dist * 20.0).max(1000.0) - ORTHO_EYE_DIST). The test\npins a point in front of the eye plane (dist = 300, 150 mm back\nfrom the target) as clipping inside.",
